        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up at <strong>The Gateway, c</strong>onfront the mirrors, and close the <strong>6 eyes</strong> of the demons keeping you imprisoned! This is a <strong>fast paced rouge-like shooter</strong>, with a combat system that forces every bullet and move to matter. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, shooting is based on a turn timer which you can influence. Every time you dash, or kill enemies the turn timer will move faster. Playing fast and reckless will allow you too attack very fast, <i>but careful not to be  too reckless!<strong> </strong></i>Missing bullets will slow down your timer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to face a demon, you will need to clear 3 <strong>randomly generated</strong> islands. Which are guarded by monsters. Survive islands with the help of <strong>perks</strong> and <strong>upgrades.</strong> These will help you become more and more powerful the further you get. With <strong>infinitely</strong> stacking perks and your own skills, the monsters will have a hard time stopping you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Areas and boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking perks and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with 7 tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up at <strong>The Gateway, c</strong>onfront the mirrors, and close the <strong>6 eyes</strong> of the demons keeping you imprisoned! This is a <strong>fast paced rouge-like shooter</strong>, with a combat system that forces every bullet and move to matter. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, shooting is based on a turn timer which you can influence. Every time you dash, or kill enemies the turn timer will move faster. Playing fast and reckless will allow you too attack very fast, <i>but careful not to be  too reckless!<strong> </strong></i>Missing bullets will slow down your timer. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to face a demon, you will need to clear 3 <strong>randomly generated</strong> islands. Which are guarded by monsters. Survive islands with the help of <strong>perks</strong> and <strong>upgrades.</strong> These will help you become more and more powerful the further you get. With <strong>infinitely</strong> stacking perks and your own skills, the monsters will have a hard time stopping you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> OPEN YOUR <span class=\"bb_strike\">EYES</span> </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Areas and boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stacking perks and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Game modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack with 7 tracks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Nothing but ocean in every direction, and monsters eyeing you down everywhere you go! Wake up, confront the monsters, and find your way home in this top down rouge-like, with a unique take on shooting mechanics. ",
